    {
      "id": "link-far-call-translation",
      "rule": "LINK 5.30 /FARCALLTRANSLATION rewrites a same-segment far call into NOP; PUSH CS; CALL near (five bytes). Write an ordinary far call to the named function; the strict matcher validates the linker transformation independently.",
      "evidence": [
